        "text": "Efficiency improvements in government should be pursued through thoughtful reform rather than destructive methods.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a moral obligation to protect essential government services that serve vulnerable populations.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Dismantling government functions via blunt force measures undermines public trust and long-term effectiveness.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Government inefficiency is widely acknowledged but poorly addressed due to political expediency.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s personal disposition toward efficiency reflects a broader societal value.",
