    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "I think that makes sense. Look, you talk to people in Canada or in England, and You ask them about the state of the NHS in England. They're not very kind about it. They love the NHS, but the NHS has a lot of problems right now. Ask any British person. Your point is taken that there's not going to be a system that magically solves every problem.",
